        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#F4F0E6;font-family:Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Georgia,serif;color:#292D2C'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='padding:1.4cqw 0;border-top:.4cqw solid #292D2C;border-bottom:.1cqw solid #292D2C;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#354B58'><span>Release notes</span><span style='color:#b45309'></span></div><div style='font:850 8.2cqw/1.02 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:3cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#292D2C'>Release Graph</div><div style='font:400 2.2cqw/1.5 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Georgia,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:62cqw'>A release of your product: what is new, what changed and what was fixed, as a few entries. Edit the entries and this page follows.</div><div style='margin-top:3cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b45309;margin-bottom:1.2cqw'>Highlights</div><div style='font:600 1.9cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#292D2C;margin-top:.5cqw'><span style='color:#b45309'>◆</span> Something you can now do</div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(53,75,88,.35)'><span style='font:700 1.5cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#15803d'>New</span><span style='font:600 1.4cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>1 change</span></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.4cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:0;background:#FCF9F1;border:1px solid #D4CABB;border-left:.7cqw solid #15803d'><div style='font:850 3.1cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#292D2C'>Something you can now do</div><div style='font:400 2.5cqw/1.55 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Georgia,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.6cqw'>One paragraph for a customer: what is new, and why it helps them.</div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(53,75,88,.35)'><span style='font:700 1.5cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1d4ed8'>Changed</span><span style='font:600 1.4cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>1 change</span></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.4cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:0;background:#FCF9F1;border:1px solid #D4CABB;border-left:.7cqw solid #1d4ed8'><div style='font:850 3.1cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#292D2C'>Something that works differently</div><div style='font:400 2.5cqw/1.55 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Georgia,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.6cqw'>What changed, and what it means for someone who used the old way.</div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(53,75,88,.35)'><span style='font:700 1.5cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b45309'>Fixed</span><span style='font:600 1.4cqw/1 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#64748b'>1 change</span></div><div style='margin-bottom:2.4cqw;padding:2.2cqw 2.6cqw;border-radius:0;background:#FCF9F1;border:1px solid #D4CABB;border-left:.7cqw solid #b45309'><div style='font:850 3.1cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#292D2C'>Something that is fixed</div><div style='font:400 2.5cqw/1.55 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Georgia,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.6cqw'>What was wrong, in the words a customer would use, and that it no longer happens.</div></div></div></div>"
